<title>USA: IDEXX acquires Advanced Veterinary Systems.</title>
<headline>IDEXX acquires Advanced Veterinary Systems.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBROOK, Maine 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDEXX Laboratories Corp said Friday it has completed the acquisition of Advanced Veterinary Systems, a supplier of veterinary practice management computer systems in Eau Claire, Wis. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>IDEXX provides diagnostic products and services for veterinary, food and environmental testing uses.</p>
